   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Association for building  Capacities of the Handicapped People (ARCAPH) that been created in accordance with arrangements of the law relative n&#xb0; 04-038 of August 05, 2004 to the associations. N&#xb0; receipt 945 G-DB.
ARCAPH) participle actively to the localdevelopment to the level of the districts by the formation, the training of profession, of leadership, the sensitization, the organization of the days of advocacies, the psychosocial development of the vulnerable layers,
The discrimination and exclusionof people living  with handicap is a major brake to the walk toward an inclusive society.
  Objectives
To allow people  living withnhandicap to participate in the local development of their township
2 - to promote the popularization of the Relative Convention to the Rights of the Handicapped People (CRDPH)
3 - facilitated the mobility of people iliving  with handicap
4 - to inform and to sensitize people handicapped on the existence of the Relative Convention to the Rights of the Handicapped People (CRDPH);
5 -
6 - to reinforce  the Empower  of the handicapped people and to increase their social inclusions;
7 - to encourage the integration of people handicapped to allow them to exercise their rights fully and to play their role in the society;
To reinforce expertises and technical, physical and intellectual capacities of the handicapped people;
8 - to promote the respect of the difference;
9 - to put to their arrangements of the specialized materials while holding in account their different handicaps (motors, visual and auditory, mental);
10 - to propose sessions of physiotherapy for the interview and the good to be of their body;
11 - to restore the credibility and the dignity of the handicapped people.
